        "error_metric": "l2",
        "procedure": "At x=80 and 90 evaluate Cf=tau_w/(0.5 rho U_b²), Re_b=U_b (2 delta)/nu and local pressure slope. Compare Cf=0.073 Re_b^(-1/4) only after station independence."
      },
