        "procedure": "Compute u_tau=sqrt(tau_w/rho), u+=U/u_tau, y+=y u_tau/nu and Re_tau=u_tau delta/nu. Select matching DNS Re_tau; the case is RANS, not a DNS reproduction."
      }
